   Management Grp; Amer Scholar Press; Jinan Univ, Alumni Assoc},
Abstract = {With the upgrading of the quality of life, tourism has become one of the
   main ways of high-quality leisure. It is no doubt that the tourism can
   promote development and prosperity of a city, but also bring some of the
   load to the environment. Environmental issues, which has become
   increasingly prominent gave birth to the low-carbon economy, low carbon
   travel is one important manifestation of the view of low-carbon economy
   and view of low carbon life. In order to harmonize the urban environment
   and economic development, actuarial environmental costs become
   particularly important through the establishment of urban environment
   cost - benefit model, quantify the relationship between the benefits of
   urban and its environmental cost for consuming. On this account,
   planning environmental costs rationally to improve the utilization of
   the environment can construct the low-carbon tourist city to the core of
   low energy consumption, low pollution, low emission, high performance,
