   Studies Vienna, Branch Off Bratislava},
Abstract = {In the years 1998-2002, research was carried out on the territories of
   selected national parks of Northeastern Poland: Biebrzanski National
   Park and Narwianski National Park. Assessment of visual features
   (aesthetic value and perceptional potential) of the landscape was
   performed. The assessment took into account the following criteria:
   natural and native character of landscape, its diversity, stability and
   the way it impressed observers. Based on the results of landscape
   valuation, principles of transformation, modification, preservation and
   conservation were formulated.},
