   PUBLIC HEALTH AND EDUCATION (SSPHE 2018)},
Series = {Advances in Social Science Education and Humanities Research},
Year = {2018},
Volume = {196},
Pages = {26-29},
Note = {2nd International Conference on Social Science, Public Health and
   Education (SSPHE), Sanya, PEOPLES R CHINA, NOV 25-27, 2018},
Abstract = {Adorno hopes to explore the redemptive function of art through the
   clarification of the expressive essence of natural beauty, and finally
   realize the equality and harmony between human and nature in
   understanding. Things have their own language as well as human beings.
   Natural beauty is the expression of nature. Art is an imitation of
   natural beauty. Through this kind of imitation, people can correctly
   understand the mute expression of the oppressed nature and the nature
   itself. The non-identified philosophy can correctly explain the natural
   beauty and art language.},
