   CHINA, NOV 22-24, 2024},
Abstract = {In this study, analysis and prediction of water resources consumption is
   executed in order to alleviate the water shortage problem especially in
   Southeast China. Nowadays, lots of Chinese cities suffered from the
   water shortage and the water environment pollution for decades. The
   demand of high quality fresh water resource becomes critical for both
   the urban and rural area due to the fast development of the economic and
   the rapid growth of the local population. Hence, the calculation and
   prediction of the water resource for the current the future year in a
   typical Chinese city is focused in order to allocate the water resource
   more efficiently and predict the water demand and water supply in the
   future. It is also valuable for different cities especially the cities
   suffered from water around the world.},
