Organization = {Tianjin Univ Commerce},
Abstract = {The 21st century is the century of advocating green environment
   protection and sustained development. Based on this philosophy, urban
   transport development mode slow traffic, which is represented by
   walking, bicycle, ``walking + bus{''} and ``bicycle + bus{''}, appears.
   Whatever BRT (Bus Rapid Transit) develops in city; it could not solve
   problems of end transportation because it is necessary to solve ``the
   last mile{''} through slow traffic. The slow traffic system, which has a
   series of advantages including low cost of traveling, green environment
   protection and fewer resource-consuming, indicates its important role in
   the urban traffic system.
   This paper, through the research on the slow traffic system and based on
   current slow traffic system construction, puts forward new urban traffic
   mode including connection of ``BRT (bus rapid transit)+PBFR (public bike
   free rental){''}, integration of ``NBT (Normal Bus Transit)+TBB (take
   bicycle on bus){''}, and planning of ``SCF (special cycle facilities) +
   SFW (special foot way)+NBT(normal bus transit){''}, providing a
   reference for exploring urban green and sustained development.},
