Abstract = {Building Information Modelling (BIM) is effective in order to build the
   environment where various information generated in a construction
   enterprise is used integrative. Although BIM is beginning to be used for
   a construction of architecture, there are few examples for a
   construction of a civil infrastructure. The proposal and use of a 3D
   product model which are the cores of BIM have just started. Therefore,
   the concrete example and application system of BIM are required. In this
   paper, the view of BIM is taken in the process of a construction
   enterprise not only including architecture but civil infrastructure, the
   information concerning a structure as a 3D-PDM and the application
   system was proposed. The 3D-PDM was proposed including temporal and
   spatial information. As a system which applied the 3D-PDM, a pedestrian
