Abstract = {Continuous observation of PM10, PM2.5, O-3 were conducted in May 2015 in
   Yuxi, The results indicated that the concentration of O-3, PM2.5 and
   PM10 is (85.23 +/- 18.20)mu g/m(3), (23.11 +/- 6.91) mu g/m(3), (49.79
