   INDOOR AIR QUALITY AND CLIMATE, VOLS 1-5},
Year = {2005},
Pages = {971-975},
Note = {10th International Conference on Indoor Air Quality and Climate (Indoor
   Air 2005), Beijing, PEOPLES R CHINA, SEP 04-09, 2005},
Organization = {Tsinghua Univ; Minist Educ China; Natl Nat Sci Fdn China; Beijing
   Municipal Commiss Sci \& Technol; Shanghai Municipal Commiss Sci \&
   Technol; US EPA; Amer Ind Hyg Assoc; Amer Soc Heating, Refrigerating \&
   Air Conditioning Engineers; Int Commiss Occupat Hlth, SC Indoor Air Qual
   \& Hlth; Int Council Res \& Innovat Bldg \& Construct; European Commiss
   Asia Pro Eco Programme Promot Sustainable Solut Environm Europe \& Asia;
   Korean Soc Indoor Environm; Soc Indoor Environm},
Abstract = {The radiant ceiling cooling is a new technology with higher comfortable
   degree in the field of air-conditioning. Physical and numerical models
   of the radiant ceiling cooling system were built and numerically
   simulated. The results showed that the lower the temperature of the
   cooling water is, the lower the surface of the ceiling, and the bigger
   the cooling capacity. Radiant heat is more than convective heat
   transferred from the ceiling to indoor environment, so the comfortable
   degree is high. By testing in the experimental room, the indoor
   temperature distributions, the wall temperature and the surface
   temperature of the ceiling in the different cooling water temperature
   were given. Radiant heat transfer and convective heat transfer were
   analyzed. Experimental results are conformed to calculating results by
   comparison. It is concluded that the room with the radiant ceiling
   cooling has well-distributed. temperature and higher comfortable degree.
   The radiant ceiling cooling is an applicable and ideal air-condition in
   a mode with a good indoor quality.},
