   Prenscia; Chongqing Technol \& Business Univ; Chinese Journal Aeronaut},
Abstract = {This paper develops two models to predict traffic flow data. People's
   demand for a good and efficient navigational system has increased. There
   are two main methods, which are Multi-Layer Perception, or MLP and the
   LSTM model. The paper talks about basic knowledge about these two models
   and also build a suitable model for traffic flow prediction using them.
   In the LSTM model, data is preprocessed at first and plugged into
   different model units to get the final predicted result. To discuss
   which model is more suitable, percentage error (compare predicted and
   actual results) is calculated and compared.},
