Abstract = {This contribution deals with the large eddy simulations of a complete
   diurnal cycle of atmospheric flow within a schematic deep valley for two
   seasons (i.e. winter and summer). The scale of interest is
   characteristic of an urban site located in a complex area, with special
   focus on low wind conditions. The results of the numerical simulations
